<title>USA: Mecklermedia Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Mecklermedia Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended	   Year Ended</p>
<p>				 September 30	     September 30,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	    1996	1995</p>
<p>Total Revenues	   6,094     2,851	    30,594  14,487</p>
<p>Total Costs		3,778     2,215	    18,631   8,862</p>
<p>Gross profit after cost</p>
<p>of sales, direct costs 2,316	 636	    11,963   5,625</p>
<p>Advertising, promotion</p>
<p>and selling expenses   2,826     1,797	     9,890   4,913</p>
<p>General and</p>
<p>administr expenses     1,572	 975	     6,807   3,566</p>
<p>Operating (loss)	 (2,082)   (2,136)	   (4,734) (2,854)</p>
<p>Interest income, net     251	 173	     1,001     299</p>
<p>Gain (loss) on sales</p>
<p>  of assets		    -	 (38)		   -  1,325</p>
<p>(Loss) before taxes   (1,831)   (2,001)	    (3,733) (1,230)</p>
<p>Provision for taxes	70	   9		  135	45</p>
<p>Net (loss)		($1,901) ($2,010)	   ($3,868)($1,275)</p>
<p>(Loss) per share	($0.23)   ($0.25)	    $(0.46) ($0.17)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk</p>
</text>
